        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Do two things at the same time",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Use 一边 before each of two compatible simultaneous actions. The actions must be possible together; this does not mean first one, then the other.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "她一边看书一边说中文。",
                "pinyin": "tā yībiān kàn shū yībiān shuō Zhōngwén 。",
                "meaning": "She reads while speaking Chinese.",
